#: ../../06-workflows.md:1 11654ceaa3f940a48b1f6730eb5ed7d2
msgid "06. Workflows"
msgstr "06. 工作流"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:5 28d81a4af53142809980668f7a8601d6
msgid ""
"Critical **runtime** paths in this tree. Channel states (`CS_*`) and the "
"state-handler contract are in [Architecture](02-architecture.md); ESL "
"commands, events, and SQL tables are in [Data and API](05-data-and-api.md). "
"Default inbound progression after create: `CS_NEW` → `CS_INIT` → "
"`CS_ROUTING` → `CS_EXECUTE` → media or hangup `CS_HANGUP` → `CS_REPORTING` →"
" `CS_DESTROY` (`src/include/switch_types.h`)."
msgstr ""
"本仓库中的关键 **运行时** 路径。通道状态（`CS_*`）与状态处理约定见 [架构](02-architecture.md)；ESL 命令、事件和 "
"SQL 表见 [数据与 API](05-data-and-api.md)。创建后的默认呼入推进：`CS_NEW` → `CS_INIT` → "
"`CS_ROUTING` → `CS_EXECUTE` → 媒体或挂断 `CS_HANGUP` → `CS_REPORTING` → "
"`CS_DESTROY`（`src/include/switch_types.h`）。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:7 33264e548c8d41f08762b1141fae49b1
msgid ""
"These flows use vanilla XML (`conf/vanilla/`). Other profiles (`conf/sbc`, "
"`conf/minimal`, `conf/curl`) change bind ports, auth, and whether "
"directory/dialplan come from files or `mod_xml_curl`. Operator-level "
"walkthrough of the same 1000→1001 call: [Users Manual Chapter "
"1](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/introduction)."
msgstr ""
"这些流程使用 vanilla "
"XML（`conf/vanilla/`）。其他配置档（`conf/sbc`、`conf/minimal`、`conf/curl`）会改变绑定端口、鉴权，以及"
" directory/dialplan 来自文件还是 `mod_xml_curl`。同一通 1000→1001 呼叫的运维走查见 [用户手册第 1 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/introduction)。"

