#: ../../06-workflows.md:16 996b3c8470514a11ac62772bd4cd1fb2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Vanilla 1000 calling 1001 (config files, not C): REGISTER on "
"`sip_profiles/internal.xml` → directory `directory/default/1000.xml` "
"(`user_context=default`) → INVITE `1001` → `dialplan/default.xml` "
"`Local_Extension` → `bridge` `user/${dialed_extension}@${domain_name}`. "
"Internal profile `context` is `public`; that value applies only to "
"**unauthenticated** inbound. Late codec negotiation: `inbound-late-"
"negotiation=true` on the internal profile."
msgstr ""
"Vanilla 分机 1000 呼叫 1001（配置文件路径，不是 C 符号）：在 `sip_profiles/internal.xml` 上 "
"REGISTER → 号码簿 `directory/default/1000.xml`（`user_context=default`）→ INVITE "
"`1001` → `dialplan/default.xml` 的 `Local_Extension` → `bridge` "
"`user/${dialed_extension}@${domain_name}`。internal profile 的 `context` 是 "
"`public`，该值只用于**未认证**入局。延迟编解码协商：internal profile 上 `inbound-late-"
"negotiation=true`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:20 e8f3c0e15e5d48dea374e20f105b1b33
msgid "Inbound SIP Call"
msgstr "呼入 SIP 呼叫"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:22 ../../06-workflows.md:121
#: ../../06-workflows.md:205 ../../06-workflows.md:293
#: ca4e5e67b30845d29b6f6b64fa50705e
msgid "Trigger and Goal"
msgstr "触发条件与目标"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:24 7eeb8fc004fb4554b0f598fd89773200
msgid ""
"**Trigger**: SIP `INVITE` arrives on a Sofia profile (vanilla internal "
"typically UDP/TCP **5060**, external **5080**). Sofia-SIP delivers "
"`nua_i_invite` to `sofia_event_callback()` in "
"`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia.c`."
msgstr ""
"**触发条件**：SIP `INVITE` 到达 Sofia 配置档（vanilla 内部通常为 UDP/TCP **5060**，外部为 "
"**5080**）。Sofia-SIP 将 `nua_i_invite` 投递给 "
"`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia.c` 中的 `sofia_event_callback()`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:25 4102057ed13e4b84aeca39b39b8573cb
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Goal**: allocate a session/channel, authenticate if the profile requires "
"it, hunt an XML extension, run applications (vanilla `Local_Extension` "
"bridges `user/${dialed_extension}@${domain_name}`), exchange media, then "
"hang up with a SIP response/`BYE`/`CANCEL` and CDR/events."
msgstr ""
"**目标**：分配会话/通道，若配置档要求则鉴权，查找 XML extension，运行应用（vanilla 的 `Local_Extension` 会"
" bridge `user/${dialed_extension}@${domain_name}`），交换媒体，然后以 SIP "
"响应/`BYE`/`CANCEL` 挂断并产生 CDR/事件。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:27 ../../06-workflows.md:128
#: ../../06-workflows.md:212 ../../06-workflows.md:298
#: 3bb504972bd147b09b2b05e0ce9af4fc
msgid "Main Flow"
msgstr "主流程"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:65 ../../06-workflows.md:159
#: ../../06-workflows.md:245 ../../06-workflows.md:327
#: c37824ad827441a2a7cffa133516fc9d
msgid "Key Steps"
msgstr "关键步骤"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:67 b4b3cce4432e404bbfc553c7dd44a782
msgid ""
"**Admit the INVITE.** `sofia_event_callback()` rejects with **503** "
"`\"Maximum Calls In Progress\"` / `\"System Busy\"` / `\"System Paused\"` "
"when session limit, message-queue critical watermark, or `PFLAG_STANDBY` is "
"hit. Missing `Call-ID` → **503** `\"INVALID INVITE\"`. Session-timer `Min-"
"SE` too small → **422**."
msgstr ""
"**准入 INVITE。** 当命中会话上限、消息队列临界水位或 `PFLAG_STANDBY` 时，`sofia_event_callback()` "
"以 **503** `\"Maximum Calls In Progress\"` / `\"System Busy\"` / `\"System "
"Paused\"` 拒绝。缺少 `Call-ID` → **503** `\"INVALID INVITE\"`。会话定时器 `Min-SE` 过小 →"
" **422**。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:68 c521c1a5994043bc9bef1a9ab70e6076
msgid ""
"**Create the inbound session.** `switch_core_session_request()` (or "
"`switch_core_session_request_uuid()` when `PFLAG_CALLID_AS_UUID`) plus "
"`sofia_glue_new_pvt()` / `sofia_glue_attach_private()`. The event is queued "
"onto the session with `switch_core_session_queue_signal_data()`; the session"
" thread starts in `CS_NEW`."
msgstr ""
"**创建呼入会话。** `switch_core_session_request()`（当 `PFLAG_CALLID_AS_UUID` 时为 "
"`switch_core_session_request_uuid()`），再加上 `sofia_glue_new_pvt()` / "
"`sofia_glue_attach_private()`。事件通过 `switch_core_session_queue_signal_data()`"
" 入队到该会话；会话线程从 `CS_NEW` 启动。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:69 a5dfedd81fbb4784941438594082e515
msgid ""
"**Handle the INVITE body.** `sofia_handle_sip_i_invite()` requires a "
"`Contact` (**400** `\"Missing Contact Header\"` otherwise). Source IP/port "
"become `sip_network_ip` / `sip_network_port`. Destination number is Request-"
"URI user (`req_user`), or the full URI when `full-id-in-dialplan` "
"(`PFLAG_FULL_ID`)."
msgstr ""
"**处理 INVITE 消息体。** `sofia_handle_sip_i_invite()` 要求有 `Contact`（否则 **400** "
"`\"Missing Contact Header\"`）。源 IP/端口成为 `sip_network_ip` / "
"`sip_network_port`。被叫号码是 Request-URI 的 user（`req_user`），或在 `full-id-in-"
"dialplan`（`PFLAG_FULL_ID`）时为完整 URI。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:70 a21080ae87984aa989f58dad02d97ca6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Authenticate when required.** Vanilla internal profile: `auth-"
"calls=$${internal_auth_calls}` (`true` in `conf/vanilla/vars.xml`) and "
"`apply-inbound-acl` = `domains`. Failed ACL can fall back to Digest. Digest "
"uses the same `sofia_reg_handle_register(..., REG_INVITE, ...)` path as "
"REGISTER. Success sets `sip_authorized=true` and loads directory XML via "
"`switch_ivr_set_user_xml()` (including `user_context`). External profile: "
"`auth-calls=false` — typically no digest; context stays the profile context "
"(`public`)."
msgstr ""
"**需要时鉴权。** Vanilla 内部配置档：`auth-"
"calls=$${internal_auth_calls}`（`conf/vanilla/vars.xml` 中为 `true`）且 `apply-"
"inbound-acl` = `domains`。ACL 失败可回退到 Digest。Digest 走与 REGISTER 相同的 "
"`sofia_reg_handle_register(..., REG_INVITE, ...)` 路径。成功后设置 "
"`sip_authorized=true`，并通过 `switch_ivr_set_user_xml()` 加载 directory XML（含 "
"`user_context`）。外部配置档：`auth-calls=false` — 通常不做 "
"digest；上下文保持为配置档上下文（`public`）。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:71 4c73a3770b5f449e9e3d9ba9148bbe50
msgid ""
"**Build the caller profile.** Context order in "
"`sofia_handle_sip_i_invite()`: ACL override → channel `user_context` → "
"profile `context` (or From-host when profile context is `_domain_`). "
"Dialplan defaults to profile `dialplan` (`XML`) unless `inbound_dialplan` is"
" set."
msgstr ""
"**构建 caller profile。** `sofia_handle_sip_i_invite()` 中的 context 顺序：ACL 覆盖 → "
"通道 `user_context` → 配置档 `context`（当配置档 context 为 `_domain_` 时用 From-"
"host）。除非设置了 `inbound_dialplan`，dialplan 默认为配置档 `dialplan`（`XML`）。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:72 e70ce93ea8af4504bf7d89871a80aaa4
msgid ""
"**Leave `CS_NEW`.** `sofia_handle_sip_i_state()` on `nua_callstate_received`"
" sets `CS_INIT` after SDP offer handling (`sofia_media_negotiate_sdp` unless"
" proxy/late-neg). `STATE_MACRO(init)` runs `sofia_on_init` then, if the "
"endpoint returns `SWITCH_STATUS_SUCCESS`, `switch_core_standard_on_init()` "
"(moves to `CS_ROUTING`, or `CS_EXECUTE` when `CF_RECOVERING`). After that "
"macro, the `CS_INIT` case fires `SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_CREATE`."
msgstr ""
"**离开 `CS_NEW`。** `sofia_handle_sip_i_state()` 在 `nua_callstate_received` 时，于"
" SDP offer 处理之后（除非 proxy/late-neg，否则走 `sofia_media_negotiate_sdp`）设置 "
"`CS_INIT`。`STATE_MACRO(init)` 先运行 `sofia_on_init`，若 endpoint 返回 "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_SUCCESS`，再运行 `switch_core_standard_on_init()`（进入 "
"`CS_ROUTING`，若 `CF_RECOVERING` 则进入 `CS_EXECUTE`）。该宏之后，`CS_INIT` 分支会触发 "
"`SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_CREATE`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:73 a5a9887a767a425bb7ae600adfa07d17
msgid ""
"**Optional 100 Trying.** `sofia_on_routing()` sends `SIP_100_TRYING` when "
"`PFLAG_AUTO_INVITE_100` and the inbound channel is not yet answered "
"(`sofia_acknowledge_call()`)."
msgstr ""
"**可选的 100 Trying。** 当 `PFLAG_AUTO_INVITE_100` "
"且呼入通道尚未应答时，`sofia_on_routing()` 发送 "
"`SIP_100_TRYING`（`sofia_acknowledge_call()`）。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:74 64747e8275d54299afbeea116c85454f
msgid ""
"**Hunt the dialplan.** `switch_core_standard_on_routing()` looks up "
"`caller_profile->dialplan` (comma-separated names) and calls "
"`hunt_function`. `mod_dialplan_xml` registers name `\"XML\"` → "
"`dialplan_hunt()`. Hunt locates `<context name=\"...\">` (fallback "
"`global`), walks `<extension>` / `<condition>` regexes (`parse_exten`). "
"Vanilla authenticated users (`user_context=default`) match `Local_Extension`"
" `^(10[01][0-9])$` in `conf/vanilla/dialplan/default.xml`."
msgstr ""
"**查找 dialplan。** `switch_core_standard_on_routing()` 查找 "
"`caller_profile->dialplan`（逗号分隔的名称）并调用 `hunt_function`。`mod_dialplan_xml` "
"将名称 `\"XML\"` 注册为 `dialplan_hunt()`。查找定位 `<context name=\"...\">`（回退 "
"`global`），遍历 `<extension>` / `<condition>` 正则（`parse_exten`）。Vanilla "
"已鉴权用户（`user_context=default`）匹配 `conf/vanilla/dialplan/default.xml` 中的 "
"`Local_Extension` `^(10[01][0-9])$`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:75 ac8d98c3544e448490f6d18adfdb76d5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Execute applications.** `switch_core_standard_on_execute()` walks "
"`extension->current_application` and "
"`switch_core_session_execute_application()`. Vanilla `Local_Extension` sets "
"`hangup_after_bridge=true` / `continue_on_fail=true`, then `bridge` "
"`user/${dialed_extension}@${domain_name}`. `audio_bridge_function()` calls "
"`switch_ivr_originate()` for the B-leg, then "
"`switch_ivr_multi_threaded_bridge()` (or `switch_ivr_signal_bridge()` when "
"`CF_PROXY_MODE`). Failed originate can fall through to voicemail via "
"`loopback/app=voicemail:...`."
msgstr ""
"**执行应用。** `switch_core_standard_on_execute()` 遍历 "
"`extension->current_application` 并调用 "
"`switch_core_session_execute_application()`。Vanilla 的 `Local_Extension` 设置 "
"`hangup_after_bridge=true` / `continue_on_fail=true`，然后 `bridge` "
"`user/${dialed_extension}@${domain_name}`。`audio_bridge_function()` 为 B-leg "
"调用 `switch_ivr_originate()`，再调用 "
"`switch_ivr_multi_threaded_bridge()`（`CF_PROXY_MODE` 时为 "
"`switch_ivr_signal_bridge()`）。originate 失败可通过 `loopback/app=voicemail:...` "
"落到语音信箱。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:76 defc6ad03baf4965847b406e649d615d
msgid ""
"**Hang up.** `switch_channel_hangup()` fires `SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_HANGUP` "
"(`src/switch_channel.c`). Session thread `CS_HANGUP` → `sofia_on_hangup()`: "
"answered → `nua_bye`; unanswered outbound → `nua_cancel`; unanswered inbound"
" → `nua_respond` with `hangup_cause_to_sip()`. Then `CS_REPORTING` → "
"`CS_DESTROY`. Vanilla CDR is `mod_cdr_csv`, not core SQL."
msgstr ""
"**挂断。** `switch_channel_hangup()` 触发 "
"`SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_HANGUP`（`src/switch_channel.c`）。会话线程 `CS_HANGUP` → "
"`sofia_on_hangup()`：已应答 → `nua_bye`；未应答的呼出 → `nua_cancel`；未应答的呼入 → 以 "
"`hangup_cause_to_sip()` 做 `nua_respond`。然后 `CS_REPORTING` → "
"`CS_DESTROY`。Vanilla CDR 由 `mod_cdr_csv` 产生，而非核心 SQL。"

