#: ../../06-workflows.md:203 2ffdda8d4b2945f499505c4441ff14fd
msgid "ESL Originate and Event Control"
msgstr "ESL Originate 与事件控制"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:207 e481a26361e5459e8fee084340d03c01
msgid ""
"**Trigger**: TCP client (`fs_cli` or custom `libs/esl`) connects to "
"`mod_event_socket`. Vanilla listen: port **8021**, password **`ClueCon`**, "
"`listen-ip` **`::`** in "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/event_socket.conf.xml`. `fs_cli` itself "
"defaults to **`127.0.0.1:8021`** / `ClueCon` (`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`)."
msgstr ""
"**触发条件**：TCP 客户端（`fs_cli` 或自定义 `libs/esl`）连接到 `mod_event_socket`。Vanilla "
"监听：端口 **8021**，密码 **`ClueCon`**，`listen-ip` **`::`**，见 "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/event_socket.conf.xml`。`fs_cli` 自身默认 "
"**`127.0.0.1:8021`** / `ClueCon`（`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`）。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:208 96bc6c5aa4a7453185a7f2a833b44571
msgid ""
"**Goal**: authenticate, then run console APIs (`api` / `bgapi`, including "
"`originate`), subscribe to events, and/or drive a live UUID with `sendmsg` "
"(`call-command: execute|hangup|…`). Outbound mode: dialplan app `socket` "
"connects **from** FreeSWITCH to a controller."
msgstr ""
"**目标**：鉴权，然后运行控制台 API（`api` / `bgapi`，包括 `originate`），订阅事件，和/或用 "
"`sendmsg`（`call-command: execute|hangup|…`）驱动活动 UUID。呼出模式：dialplan 应用 "
"`socket` **从** FreeSWITCH 连到控制器。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:210 1cf575d945b64fdea99075b2c7045608
msgid ""
"Do not bind ESL beyond loopback in production without changing `ClueCon` — "
"vanilla `listen-ip` is `::` (all interfaces). **[NEEDS INPUT: site ESL bind "
"and password]**."
msgstr ""
"生产环境不要在未更改 `ClueCon` 的情况下把 ESL 绑到回环以外 — vanilla 的 `listen-ip` 是 "
"`::`（所有接口）。**[NEEDS INPUT: 站点 ESL 绑定地址与密码]**。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:247 a94969fb28334d88a5f1b6177a92c9d8
msgid ""
"**Accept and challenge.** Listener thread sends `Content-Type: "
"auth/request`. Until `LFLAG_AUTHED`, only `auth <password>` (compared to "
"`prefs.password`) or `userauth user@domain:pass` (directory `esl-password` /"
" `esl-allowed-api` / `esl-allowed-events`) are accepted. Wrong password: "
"`-ERR invalid` and the socket is closed."
msgstr ""
"**接受并质询。** 监听线程发送 `Content-Type: auth/request`。在 `LFLAG_AUTHED` 之前，只接受 `auth"
" <password>`（与 `prefs.password` 比较）或 `userauth user@domain:pass`（directory 的"
" `esl-password` / `esl-allowed-api` / `esl-allowed-events`）。密码错误：`-ERR "
"invalid` 并关闭套接字。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:248 4fc8c215bc7448eaa2db0a49ceb8a4a3
msgid ""
"**Parse commands.** `parse_command()` in `mod_event_socket.c`. After auth: "
"`api`, `bgapi` (async + `Job-UUID` + `BACKGROUND_JOB`), `event` / `nixevent`"
" / `noevents` / `myevents`, `sendmsg`, `sendevent`, `getvar`, `log`, "
"`linger`, `exit` (`+OK bye`). Replies are `+OK` or `-ERR`."
msgstr ""
"**解析命令。** `mod_event_socket.c` 中的 `parse_command()`。鉴权后：`api`、`bgapi`（异步 + "
"`Job-UUID` + `BACKGROUND_JOB`）、`event` / `nixevent` / `noevents` / "
"`myevents`、`sendmsg`、`sendevent`、`getvar`、`log`、`linger`、`exit`（`+OK "
"bye`）。回复为 `+OK` 或 `-ERR`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:249 6ee4a674276b4ed3b2656f4a426437ae
msgid ""
"**`api originate`.** `originate_function` in `mod_commands.c`. Syntax: "
"`<call url> <exten>|&<application_name>(<app_args>) [<dialplan>] [<context>]"
" [<cid_name>] [<cid_num>] [<timeout_sec>]`. Defaults: dialplan `XML`, "
"context `default`, timeout **60s**. Calls `switch_ivr_originate()`. On "
"success the new session is transferred into the extension or `&app(args)` "
"inline extension; on failure `-ERR` plus `switch_channel_cause2str(cause)`."
msgstr ""
"**`api originate`。** `mod_commands.c` 中的 `originate_function`。语法：`<call url>"
" <exten>|&<application_name>(<app_args>) [<dialplan>] [<context>] "
"[<cid_name>] [<cid_num>] [<timeout_sec>]`。默认：dialplan `XML`，context "
"`default`，超时 **60s**。调用 `switch_ivr_originate()`。成功时新会话转入 extension 或 "
"`&app(args)` 内联 extension；失败则 `-ERR` 加上 `switch_channel_cause2str(cause)`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:250 adc49defd4fe4455a28b71229f43cf4b
msgid ""
"**Outbound SIP leg.** `sofia_outgoing_channel()` sets `TFLAG_OUTBOUND` and "
"`CS_INIT`. `sofia_on_init()` then `sofia_glue_do_invite()` sends the INVITE."
" Core also fires `SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_ORIGINATE` for outbound legs."
msgstr ""
"**呼出 SIP 腿。** `sofia_outgoing_channel()` 设置 `TFLAG_OUTBOUND` 和 `CS_INIT`。随后 "
"`sofia_on_init()` 再由 `sofia_glue_do_invite()` 发送 INVITE。核心还会为呼出腿触发 "
"`SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_ORIGINATE`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:251 5851245272f048dabf81d8c59c7e9ae4
msgid ""
"**`sendmsg`.** Headers include `call-command`. `switch_ivr_parse_event()` "
"hashes `execute` (needs `execute-app-name` / `execute-app-arg`), `hangup`, "
"`nomedia`, `unicast`, `xferext`. With a UUID, the event is queued on that "
"session (`switch_core_session_queue_private_event`); outbound `socket` "
"sessions may run it inline."
msgstr ""
"**`sendmsg`。** 头字段包含 `call-command`。`switch_ivr_parse_event()` 哈希 "
"`execute`（需要 `execute-app-name` / `execute-app-"
"arg`）、`hangup`、`nomedia`、`unicast`、`xferext`。有 UUID "
"时事件入队到该会话（`switch_core_session_queue_private_event`）；呼出 `socket` 会话可内联执行。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:252 1f4688cdf92844d6948655e3e9e127cb
msgid ""
"**Outbound ESL (`socket` app).** `SWITCH_ADD_APP(..., \"socket\", ..., "
"socket_function, \"<ip>[:<port>]\")`. The channel connects out; the "
"controller sends the same `sendmsg` vocabulary. `LFLAG_OUTBOUND` without "
"`LFLAG_FULL` skips inbound-only commands (`api`, `sendevent`, …)."
msgstr ""
"**呼出 ESL（`socket` 应用）。** `SWITCH_ADD_APP(..., \"socket\", ..., "
"socket_function, \"<ip>[:<port>]\")`。通道向外连接；控制器发送同一套 `sendmsg` "
"词汇。`LFLAG_OUTBOUND` 且无 `LFLAG_FULL` 时跳过仅呼入命令（`api`、`sendevent`、…）。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:253 bd8586a035c84f1eaddf95cc359a84ae
msgid ""
"**Events to the client.** `mod_event_socket` binds `SWITCH_EVENT_ALL`. "
"Serialize with `switch_event_serialize()` (plain) or JSON. Do not block the "
"event thread (`switch_event.h`)."
msgstr ""
"**发给客户端的事件。** `mod_event_socket` 绑定 `SWITCH_EVENT_ALL`。用 "
"`switch_event_serialize()`（plain）或 JSON 序列化。不要阻塞事件线程（`switch_event.h`）。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:255 e8a9ccfe53414781a18fdcf2cca17290
msgid ""
"`bgapi` is the non-blocking form of `api`; `originate` itself can block up "
"to the timeout (the API logs a notice if invoked on an existing session)."
msgstr ""
"`bgapi` 是 `api` 的非阻塞形式；`originate` 本身可阻塞直到超时（若在已有会话上调用，API 会记一条 notice）。"

