#: ../../06-workflows.md:295 6f6c5abcfd5c4c6bb6994a4dd930ed9a
msgid ""
"**Trigger**: console/ESL `reloadxml` (`reload_xml_function` in "
"`mod_commands.c`), or `reloadacl` / `sofia profile <name> rescan` which also"
" call `switch_xml_reload()`."
msgstr ""
"**触发条件**：控制台/ESL `reloadxml`（`mod_commands.c` 中的 "
"`reload_xml_function`），或同样会调用 `switch_xml_reload()` 的 `reloadacl` / `sofia "
"profile <name> rescan`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:296 c92536da4e4a44cd9577143ca8ce50c4
msgid ""
"**Goal**: re-parse `conf_dir` + `freeswitch.xml` (vanilla root "
"`conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml` with preprocessor includes), replace "
"`MAIN_XML_ROOT`, fire `SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML` so **new** dialplan hunts and"
" directory locates see the new tree. In-flight sessions keep the extension "
"they already hunted."
msgstr ""
"**目标**：重新解析 `conf_dir` + `freeswitch.xml`（vanilla 根为带预处理器 include 的 "
"`conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`），替换 `MAIN_XML_ROOT`，触发 "
"`SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML`，使**新的** dialplan 查找和 directory "
"定位看到新树。进行中的会话仍保留已经查到的 extension。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:325 d98b6ae8a88b412caaed4409f8771b89
#, python-format
msgid ""
"(`reload_xml_function` always prints `+OK [%s]` with the `err` string from "
"`switch_xml_reload` — including failure text. Check the bracketed message, "
"not only `+OK`.)"
msgstr ""
"（`reload_xml_function` 始终打印带 `switch_xml_reload` 返回的 `err` 字符串的 `+OK [%s]` —"
" 包括失败文本。请检查方括号内的消息，不要只看 `+OK`。）"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:329 6b8e98a1feb9418caabcadad8693fd76
msgid ""
"**Re-open root.** `switch_xml_reload()` → `switch_xml_open_root(1, err)` → "
"`__switch_xml_open_root()`. Path: `SWITCH_GLOBAL_dirs.conf_dir` + "
"`SWITCH_GLOBAL_filenames.conf_name`. Preprocessor expands `X-PRE-PROCESS` / "
"`#include` / `#set`. Flattened copy remains `freeswitch.xml.fsxml` (do not "
"edit while running)."
msgstr ""
"**重新打开 root。** `switch_xml_reload()` → `switch_xml_open_root(1, err)` → "
"`__switch_xml_open_root()`。路径：`SWITCH_GLOBAL_dirs.conf_dir` + "
"`SWITCH_GLOBAL_filenames.conf_name`。预处理器展开 `X-PRE-PROCESS` / `#include` / "
"`#set`。展平副本仍为 `freeswitch.xml.fsxml`（运行中不要编辑）。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:330 7c1cbe6a9c994e3c82fd76b0e9bbd25e
msgid ""
"**Commit or keep old.** Parse error: `switch_xml_error()` copied to `err`, "
"new tree discarded, previous root stays. Success: "
"`switch_xml_set_root(new_main)`, `err` = `\"Success\"`."
msgstr ""
"**提交或保留旧树。** 解析错误：`switch_xml_error()` 复制到 `err`，新树丢弃，保留原 "
"root。成功：`switch_xml_set_root(new_main)`，`err` = `\"Success\"`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:331 3efd65872b7c4916a0ad21e8ca8c59c5
msgid ""
"**Notify.** If a root is returned, `SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML` is fired "
"(`switch_xml_open_root`). Modules that `switch_event_bind(..., "
"SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML, ...)` refresh themselves (examples in-tree: "
"`mod_voicemail` does not bind this id for its main config in the same way; "
"`mod_enum`, `mod_cidlookup`, `mod_loopback`, `mod_avmd`, "
"`mod_tts_commandline` do)."
msgstr ""
"**通知。** 若返回了 root，则触发 `SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML`（`switch_xml_open_root`）。通过 "
"`switch_event_bind(..., SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML, ...)` "
"绑定的模块会自行刷新（树内示例：`mod_voicemail` 不以同样方式绑定该 id "
"来刷新主配置；`mod_enum`、`mod_cidlookup`、`mod_loopback`、`mod_avmd`、`mod_tts_commandline`"
" 会绑定）。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:332 85b7bf7767434fb98135df09125cbe18
msgid ""
"**What picks up immediately.** Next `dialplan_hunt()` / "
"`switch_xml_locate_user()` reads the new root. Vanilla file users without "
"`cacheable` are re-read from XML."
msgstr ""
"**立即生效的部分。** 下一次 `dialplan_hunt()` / `switch_xml_locate_user()` 读取新 root。没有 "
"`cacheable` 的 vanilla 文件用户会从 XML 重新读取。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:333 a7268064345d4b9091257e9d20fd873e
msgid ""
"**What does not auto-apply.** `mod_sofia` does **not** bind "
"`SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML`. SIP profile parameters, gateways, and codecs need "
"`sofia profile <name> rescan` (that API itself calls `switch_xml_reload` "
"then `config_sofia(SOFIA_CONFIG_RESCAN)`). ACL lists: `reloadacl` reloads "
"XML **and** `switch_load_network_lists(SWITCH_TRUE)`. Loaded DSOs: `reload "
"<module>` is separate from XML."
msgstr ""
"**不会自动生效的部分。** `mod_sofia` **不会**绑定 `SWITCH_EVENT_RELOADXML`。SIP "
"配置档参数、网关和编解码需要 `sofia profile <name> rescan`（该 API 自身先调用 `switch_xml_reload`"
" 再 `config_sofia(SOFIA_CONFIG_RESCAN)`）。ACL 列表：`reloadacl` 重载 XML **并且**调用 "
"`switch_load_network_lists(SWITCH_TRUE)`。已加载的 DSO：`reload <module>` 与 XML "
"是分开的。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:335 5f01558040844a3091664dd9ebdc90dc
msgid ""
"`mod_xml_curl` (when enabled) may replace `__switch_xml_open_root` via "
"`switch_xml_set_open_root_function()` — then “reload” is whatever that hook "
"does (HTTP fetch). **[NEEDS INPUT: whether this deploy uses `mod_xml_curl` "
"for live XML]**."
msgstr ""
"`mod_xml_curl`（启用时）可通过 `switch_xml_set_open_root_function()` 替换 "
"`__switch_xml_open_root` — 此时“reload”就是该钩子所做的事（HTTP 拉取）。**[NEEDS INPUT: "
"本次部署是否用 `mod_xml_curl` 提供实时 XML]**。"

